 anyone he  needs to or cause a massacre to complete  that mission and speaking of using  people let's get into his nen ability  skill hunter with this he conjures a  book with a large handprint on it and if  very specific restrictions have been met  he can steal the net abilities of  another person leaving the original  owner with no access to it these  conditions are seeing an ability being  used with his own eyes asking the target  questions about their nen and then  having them answer it and then having  them touch their palm to the cover of  his book  all within one hour then to actually use  the stolen ability krollo needs to open  the book to the correct page and keep it  open until he's done with that ability  on top of all of that if the original  owner of the netability dies they are  removed from the book unless the ability  is copied after that person died which  is complicated enough in its own right  to make a pretty solid set of  restrictions now the part about needing  to keep the book open has a bit of a  loophole to it using double face crollo  is able to keep the book open onto a  specific page without the use of his own  hands and he can even bookmark it to  another page effectively allowing him to  fight freely while using two stolen  techniques at once to date we've only  seen him use nine stolen abilities which  i will cover super briefly because  otherwise we'd be here all day these  include indoor fish which summon fish  skeletons inside of a sealed room these  fish will devour people however while  they do so the targets will remain alive  conscious and free of pain throughout  the entire experience fun fun cloth can  shrink anything a created cloth covers  until it fits in the user's palm  teleportation is well teleportation the  sun and moon marks each of crolo's hand  with either a sun or a moon then he can  touch a person with his hand to leave  that correlating mark on them if he  manages to touch the symbol again with  the other hand 