oint where she would  sacrifice herself for the betterment of  the group pakunoda despite not really  being a fighter was typically able to  hold her own pretty well her nan ability  is what really makes her special though  psychometry which i'm probably  mispronouncing let me know in the  comments if i am allows her to read  people's memories to expose weaknesses  or secrets couple this with her innate  ability to tell when people are lying  and he got a pretty powerful tool in  collecting information she could even  use this to see objects which were  previously in an area to get a better  sense of what happened in a room this  could also be coupled with her weapons  by shooting memories into people's heads  with conjured bullets called memory  bombs if she extracted someone's  memories beforehand and shot that memory  back into their mind though it would  cause them to lose that memory entirely  and that brings us to shall narc he was  one of the physically weakest in the  troop but he was also one of the most  intellectual he's kind of the nerd of  the group loving to play with  electronics and toy-like things more so  than fight people directly at first  glance he might seem like one of the  kindest however he's probably one of the  least empathetic in the entire group  valuing his own life very little and the  lives of others even less often  referring to them as playthings or toys  his ability black voice allows him to  stick an antenna onto someone and then  control them like a puppet or setting  them onto autopilot he could also put  himself on autopilot which essentially  makes him go super saiyan for a short  time he gets massive buffs to his  strength and speed however he won't be  able to leave autopilot until the  mission is complete and afterwards he's  in immense pain and loses his memory of  the entire event number seven is  franklin probably the member with the  most passion and loyalty for the troop  even if it's in a pretty kind of twisted  way if it came down to it he would  gladly kill every other member of the  troop and restart it from scratch if it  meant that the troop could continue in  some way luckily it didn't come down to  that his net ability is pretty  straightforward he can turn his fingers  into machine guns which have devastating  power  he even decided to cut off the tips of  his own fingers to create a self-imposed  limitation drastically increasing the  ability's effect and there really isn't  that much more to what he can do he's  just frankenstein with machine guns for  hands  number eight is my personal favorite  member of the group shizuku this is of  course excluding crolo and hisoka who  are kind of in their own situations  but honestly i mean both her and machi  are top tier waifus and i won't hear any  slander against them in the comments  shizuku has a horribly bad memory and  will even forget the names of the people  she knows pretty well and she can often  be presented as being very cold or  almost even soulless rarely reacting to  anything her nan ability is blinky which  is adorable but still horrifying blinky  is a vacuum cleaner who can absorb an  infinite amount of non-living things but  it won't suck up anything that's alive  or made of men furthermore it can vomit  up the last thing that it absorbed if  it's needed this is particularly useful  to the group as it allows her to suck up  things like traps or even just bloody  crime scenes this might not seem like  the most effective thing in combat but  she does manage pretty well using blinky  as a club on top of that if the opponent  has any cuts or bleeding wounds she can  have blinky suck up all of the blood in  their body until they're drained dry  bona lenov is member number 10 and might  be  the most forgettable character in the  entire group to me he is a boxer covered  in bandages to look almost like a mummy  which should be pretty unique and  memorable but i don't know something  about him just never jumped out to me  the reason he looks like this is because  under all of the bandages and gloves his  body is riddled with holes when he  fights these holes make a kind of music  that he's able to kind of move and dance  to throughout the battle and on top of  that all of his nun abilities revolve  around that music this effect is called  battle canterbile prologue it's more or  less just the music created through the  hole and the effects that it can create  the most powerful ability that we've  seen come out of this though is battle  cantable jupiter summoning a mini  jupiter to crush any opponent who can  hear his music and i know i said mini  jupiter but like mini in the sense that  it isn't as big as the actual planet the  thing is still pretty damn huge  our original number 11 was uvogin  basically this is sabretooth from marvel  on steroids he is incredibly fast strong  and resistant to pain and is easily the  strongest physically in the troop even  just his scream is able to kill people  around him all of that makes sense when  you consider him a very proficient nen  enhancer though speaking of nen his main  move was big bang impact focusing all of  his energy into one fist and then  punching his target so hard that he  creates an explosion equal to that of a  missile of course he was taken out  pretty early on and replaced by our  current number 11 illumi zoldic this is  kilua's big brother and just generally a  just very creepy non-emotive character  that for much of the story was kind of  the boogeyman and he fits that bill  pretty effectively he does however seem  to have a pretty good sense of humor  when it comes to being around hisoka  much like kaluto ilumi is also an  assassin so he has the training in all  those normal assassin abilities albeit  to a much stronger degree than kaluto  does he also has access to netan and  he's a manipulator with a lot of weird  stuff at his disposal he's able to  manipulate bodies freely using needles  to hold those changes in place which  allows him to look like other people as  a result he can also implant needles in  people's brains to hypnotize them for  example leading to kilauea's drastic  fear of him  or control corpses or even large groups  of people by attaching needles to them  all of this as someone who is terrified  of needles is just the grossest thing  possible but when it comes to an  antagonist who is meant to be creepy  it's pretty perfect  finally we have our last leg and the  last deceased member being number 12  cortopi he is an incredibly short  cyclops knockoff version of cousin it  from the addams family and yes i know he  has two eyes do not get nitpicky with me  you know what i mean we rarely ever see  him talking and all he ever really does  is agree with what other people ask of  him again kind of a forgettable  character however his design at least is  unique i guess courtopy's abilities are  more in line with support being able to  make exact copies of anything that he  touches that said he can't create life  so if he copies a person you would  basically have an inanimate copy of that  person the copies last for about a day  and then vanish but for the entirety of  their existence he's able to know  exactly where they are by touching the  original and that leads us to the leader  of the troop chrollo lucifer this man  has a lot going on but if i had to  describe him i think charismatic would  be the word that i chose he is a natural  leader and easily gets people to follow  him and act according to his will at  face value he comes across as very soft  polite and caring and to a large degree  that's very genuine which is often why  people are drawn to him in the first  place but he's also a cunning strategist  who makes the most out of every  situation and knows what people want  crollo's goal in every situation is to  have perspective on the world and the  people around him at all times but at  the end of the day if he has a mission  in place he will gladly use anyone he  needs to or cause a massacre to complete  that mission and speaking of using  people let's get into his nen ability  skill hunter with this he conjures a  book with a large handprint on it and if  very specific restrictions have been met  he can steal the net abilities of  another person leaving the original  owner with no access to it these  conditions are seeing an ability being  used with his own eyes asking the target  questions about their nen and then  having them answer it and then having  them touch their palm to the cover of  his book  all within one hour then to actually use  the stolen ability krollo needs to open  the book to the correct page and keep it  open until he's done with that ability  on top of all of that if the original  owner of the netability dies they are  removed from the book unless the ability  is copied after that person died which  is complicated enough in its own right  to make a pretty solid set of  restrictions now the part about needing  to keep the book open has a bit of a  loophole to it using double face crollo  is able to keep the book open onto a  specific page without the use of his own  hands and he can even bookmark it to  another page effectively allowing him to  fight freely while using two stolen  techniques at once to date we've only  seen him use nine stolen abilities which  i will cover super briefly because  otherwise we'd be here all day these  include indoor fish which summon fish  skeletons inside of a sealed room these  fish will devour people however while  they do so the targets will remain alive  conscious and free of pain throughout  the entire experience fun fun cloth can  shrink anything a created cloth covers  until it fits in the user's palm  teleportation is well teleportation the  sun and moon marks each of crolo's hand  with either a sun or a moon then he can  touch a person with his hand to leave  that correlating mark on them if he  manages to touch the symbol again with  the other hand that person will explode  kind of like being a very flashy version  of soy phone from bleach order stamp  allows him to tell corpses what to do if  they still have a head by placing a mark  on them convert hands allows him to make  someone else take on his appearance or  to take on their appearance himself  lovely ghost writer allows him to  predict the future of a person if they  write their full name birthday and blood  type on a piece of paper although he is  unable to check his own future and these  prophecies will always take the form of  a poem gallery fake was copied from  cortopi which just allows him to make  copies the same way that courtope did  but when combined with order stamp  allows him to essentially create a  zombie puppet army and black voice was  borrowed from shelnark and allows him to  manipulate people with an antenna  and that's it we have officially cleared  a quick look through every phantom troop  member and their abilities which members  are your favorites and which abilities  do you like most as far as characters go  i think i like crollo hisoka shizuku and  then machi while in terms of abilities i  really like kaluto krollo and machi i'd  love to hear what you think in the  comments down below though and are there  any phantom troop members that you don't  like very much i know they tend to be  very hit or miss so i'd like to hear  what you guys think if you guys enjoyed  this hunter hunter video though and want  to see more on the channel please leave  a like and if you're new to anime uproar  remember to subscribe and ring the bell  by selecting all notifications you can  guarantee that you will not miss any  videos in the future and of course if  you want to follow anime upper on  twitter and instagram you can check out  at anime uproar or you can find myself  at excellionyt i want to give a big  thank you to all of our anime uproar  patrons who make videos like this one  possible special thanks to alpha sigma  who is an absolute mad